  "markdown": "Where we work\n\n# London and the surrounding areas.\n\nWe cover London and the surrounding areas, and work UK-wide for selected projects. These are the areas we are asked about most. The method is the same in each: a survey, a written scope by room, the same core team, and a return visit once the paper has settled.\n\n[Discuss your location](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/)\n\n![Narrow bedside at Brown's Hotel, Mayfair, papered in pale tree-and-leaf wallcovering, with a sculptural bronze lamp, a wall light and a green patterned headboard.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/browns-hotel-mayfair-10.jpg)\n\nOur work in Mayfair: a finished guest room at [Brown's Hotel](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/browns-hotel-mayfair/), Albemarle Street, W1.Photograph: Mr Wallcover.\n\n## [Wallpaper installation in Mayfair](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/mayfair/)\n\nWallpaper and wallcovering installation in Mayfair, W1. Main decorating contractor at Brown's Hotel, 2022–2024. Survey, supply, hang and aftercare.\n\n[Explore Mayfair](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/mayfair/)\n\n![Finished white columned entrance and black railings on St George's Square, Pimlico, with the scaffold down.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/pimlico-st-georges-square-exterior-11.jpg)\n\nNo Belgravia commission is on the public record yet. Our nearest in SW1: the finished stucco entrance at [St George's Square, Pimlico](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/pimlico-st-georges-square/).Photograph: Mr Wallcover.\n\n## [Wallpaper installation in Belgravia](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/belgravia/)\n\nWallpaper and wallcovering installation in Belgravia and Knightsbridge, SW1. Silk, grasscloth, fabric walling and hand-painted papers, with aftercare included.\n\n[Explore Belgravia](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/belgravia/)\n\n![Penny Morrison showroom at 9 Langton Street, with floral wallpaper, a marble fireplace and upholstered seating.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/penny-morrison-showroom-01.jpg)\n\nOur work in Chelsea: the finished [Penny Morrison showroom](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/penny-morrison-showroom/), with green joinery, floral wallpaper and displayed lampshades.Photograph: Mr Wallcover.\n\n## [Wallpaper installation in Chelsea](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/chelsea/)\n\nWallpaper installation in Chelsea, SW3 and SW10. Hand-painted papers, grasscloth, silk and murals, hung by a London practice. Aftercare included.\n\n[Explore Chelsea](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/chelsea/)\n\n![Cadence Oxblood behind BEVERLY 1975's tables during Brompton Design District.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/beverly-08-800.webp)\n\nOur work in South Kensington: Calico Wallpaper Cadence behind BEVERLY 1975's tables at [The Lavery, Cromwell Place](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/calico-beverly-1975-cadence/), during Brompton Design District.Photograph: Dorin Burcus / Mr Wallcover.\n\n## [Wallpaper installation in Kensington](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/kensington/)\n\nWallpaper and wallcovering installation in Kensington and Holland Park, W8 and W11. Survey, supply, hang and aftercare from a London practice.\n\n[Explore Kensington](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/kensington/)\n\n![Suite bedroom at Hyde London City wrapped in House of Hackney Limerence palm wallpaper.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/old-bailey-12-800.webp)\n\nOur work in the City: a suite bedroom in House of Hackney Limerence at [Hyde London City, 15 Old Bailey](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/old-bailey-hotel/), EC4M.Photograph: Dorin Burcus / Mr Wallcover.\n\n## [Wallcovering installation in the City of London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/city-of-london/)\n\nHotel and commercial wallcovering installation in the City of London: Four Seasons Ten Trinity Square and Hyde London City, the Old Bailey Hotel.\n\n[Explore City of London](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/city-of-london/)\n\n![Bedroom at the Castle of Trematon in a large floral wallpaper.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/trematon-15-800.webp)\n\nNo Cotswolds commission is on the public record yet. Country-house work outside London: a finished bedroom at [Trematon Castle](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/trematon-castle/), Cornwall.Photograph: Dorin Burcus / Mr Wallcover.\n\n## [Wallpaper installation in the Cotswolds](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/cotswolds/)\n\nLondon wallpaper installers for country houses in the Cotswolds. Hand-painted papers, grasscloth, silk and fabric walling, with survey, supply and aftercare.\n\n[Explore Cotswolds](https://www.mrwallcover.com/areas/cotswolds/)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
